    "url": "https://x.com/undescrib3d/status/2069736140815384924",
    "text": "Day 27 – I went full psycho on the cars. 🔥 #ApeCode\n\nColors, spoilers, proper type characteristics, optimized wheel arches & suspension.\n\nFirst cut: top = where we started  \nbottom = what it looks like now\n\nGTA 6 is officially trembling. @RockstarGames \nCall me crazy… but @threejs is about to build GTA 7 😌 This shit went from “meh” to straight-up banger in 24 hours.  \n\nI don’t need Fable 5 anymore. I’m teaching Opus to that level, and beyond.  \nNo one can hold me back from this point on.\n\nNo more toy cars. These feel like real vehicles now.  \nSoon open-source, follow so you don’t miss it.\n\nBe brutal, which direction next?  \nMuscle car? Supercar? Truck? Hoverbike? 👀🦧",
